# Flutter / Dart / HarmonyOS generated files
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
native/rust_signer/target/
# hdc_transport 是独立的 cargo 工程，先前的规则只覆盖了 rust_signer，
# 结果它的构建产物被 git add -A 带了进来（989 个文件 / 150MB）。
native/hdc_transport/**/target/
**/.hvigor/
**/oh_modules/
**/.ohpm/
**/node_modules/
app/.flutter-plugins*
**/local.properties
**/.metadata
app/ohos/har/
app/ohos/entry/libs/arm64-v8a/libapp.so
app/plugins/ohos_adapter/example/

# 构建产物：Rust 的 target/ 会到几百 MB，误提交一次就永久留在历史里
**/target/

# Keep only the final release artifact, added explicitly.
dist/

# Technical documents stay in the private repository.
/docs/
